#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Welcome to KDE Desktop Sharing"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"KDE Desktop Sharing allows you to invite somebody at a remote location to "
"watch and possibly control your desktop. To invite somebody using email, "
"press the 'Invite via Email' button. If you would like to tell somebody how "
"to login personally, or via telephone, use the 'Create Personal Invitation' "
"button. To see existing invitations or cancel them use the 'Manage "
"Invitations' button."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Create &Personal Invitation..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Will create a new invitation and display it to you. Use this option if you "
"want to invite somebody personally."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Invite via &Email..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"This button will start your email application with a pre-configured text "
"that explains to the recipient how to connect to your computer. "
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "&Manage Invitations%1..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:13
