msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "&Accept Connection"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"This button grants the request. The remote user can now watch your desktop "
"and, if you selected it above, control your computer."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "&Refuse Connection"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"This button will refuse the connection. You should choose this unless you "
"trust the requesting user."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Attention"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:40
msgid ""
"Somebody is requesting a RFB (VNC) connection to your computer. \n"
"Granting this will allow them to see everything on your screen and, if the "
"option below is enabled, be able to control it. Refuse the connection unless "
"you trust the person."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Remote system:"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:42
msgid "123.234.123.234"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Allow remote user to &control keyboard and mouse"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:44
msgid ""
"If you turn this option on, the remote user can enter keystrokes and use "
"your mouse pointer. This gives them full control over your computer, so be "
"careful. When the option is disabled the remote user can only watch your "
"screen."
msgstr ""

