msgid "Personal Invitation"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"In order to connect to your computer, the other person can use any VNC "
"client. There must be a network connection between both computers. If there "
"are any firewalls between your computers they must have been configured "
"accordingly. Below is the information that you need to give to the other "
"person. Note that everybody who knows the password can connect, so be "
"careful. \n"
"For security reasons this invitation is only valid for one hour."
msgstr ""

